  "Choose Open PDF on the start screen, or open another file from the File menu. Use the document tabs to switch PDFs. Each document keeps its own changes.": "在开始页选择“打开 PDF”，或通过“文件”菜单打开其他文件。使用文档标签切换 PDF，每份文档的修改独立保留。",
  "Choose Edit, then select text or an image on the page. The tools above the document follow your selection. Finish typing before switching tools or documents.": "选择“编辑”，再选中页面中的文字或图片。文档上方会显示对应工具。输入完成后，再切换工具或文档。",
