  "On the web, Download copy saves an edited PDF through your browser. On desktop, choose a save destination for your first copy, then use Save to update it. Export offers additional formats and options.": "网页版通过“下载副本”在浏览器中下载修改后的 PDF。桌面版首次保存副本时选择目标位置，之后使用“保存”更新该副本。“导出”提供其他格式和选项。",
