  "Use the AI tools to translate, explain or revise selected text without signing in. For layout-preserving PDF translation, connect a KolmoPDF API key in the document translation panel. Sign in for KOMO conversations; on desktop, KOMO can also help edit PDFs and work with files in an opened folder.": "无需登录，即可用 AI 工具翻译、解释或修改选中文字。整份 PDF 的保版式翻译需要在文档翻译面板中连接 KolmoPDF API Key。KOMO 对话需要登录；桌面版 KOMO 还可以协助编辑 PDF 和处理已打开文件夹中的文件。",
  "Using a text AI tool sends the selected text to the AI service. KOMO requests may also include page images and recent conversation. Web conversations are kept in the current tab; desktop tasks may send the materials needed for the requested work.": "使用文本 AI 工具时，所选文字会发送给 AI 服务。KOMO 请求还可能包含页面图像和最近的对话。网页对话保留在当前标签页中；桌面任务可能发送完成所需工作的相关资料。",
  "We save your language preference, document recovery data and translation job history on this device. You can manage browser storage in your browser settings. Files generated by the desktop app remain on your computer until you remove them.": "语言偏好、文档恢复数据和翻译任务记录保存在此设备上。你可以在浏览器设置中管理本地存储。桌面应用生成的文件会保留在电脑上，直到你将其删除。",
